# A permanent that phases out is removed from combat (CR 702.26b, 506.4). Bot1's Llanowar Elves attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's
# Elvish Mystic blocks it; in the declare blockers step Bot1 casts Teferi's Protection. The Elves phase out, so they deal and
# are dealt no combat damage: the Mystic survives undamaged, and so do the Elves, which phase in as Bot1's turn 5 begins.
# Protection from everything prevents all damage that would be dealt to its player (CR 702.16e, 702.16j): the Mystic attacking
# Bot1 on turn 4 deals none. On turn 6 the protection is over (CR 611.2b) and the same attack deals 1 - the positive control.

